  "context": [
    {
      "id": "guides/warlock.html#s6:12",
      "text": "2026-09-20 \u2014 Added \u00a70.1 (merc survival) from a mercenary screen + three tooltip screenshots and the Holy Freeze skill tooltip: diagnosis is defense 1,853 and 10 % leech, not resists or life; Fortitude in an eth 4os Dusk Shroud (Lo ~5.9 + base 0.25\u20130.8) jumps ahead of the helm and Giant Thresher that the \u00a70 merc bullet had queued. Sacred Armor excluded on the merc's 204 str. Cure/Bulwark mods left unverified (\u00a77 item 5); Prayer+Meditation pairing not asserted.",
      "reason": "Historical review log; current guidance is in the guide body"
    },
    {
      "id": "guides/warlock.html#s6:13",
      "text": "2026-09-20 \u2014 User-approved click reduction: Mage Plate, Monarch, Dusk Shroud, Archon Plate, Wire Fleece, Sacred Armor, Kris and Cinquedeas moved to Superior + gray only. Removed all Tiara/Diadem base visibility, including the overlapping circlet category in both base-weapon rules; explicit armor codes preserve Circlet/Coronet visibility. Plain Flail, crafting boots/belts, low runes, gems and all other drops retain their prior visibility. This deliberately sacrifices unsocketed non-Superior Kris/Cinquedeas with skill bonuses and Tiara/Diadem runeword or imbue fodder. Codes verified against d2data armor/weapons dumps; profile structure and visibility changes checked locally. In-game import/Alt verification remains pending. The older General (ALL) profile was not changed.",
      "reason": "Historical review log; current guidance is in the guide body"
    },
    {
      "id": "guides/warlock.html#s6:14",
      "text": "2026-09-18 \u2014 Caster Belt base was listed as Sash / Demonhide Sash / Spiderweb Sash (that is the Safety Belt recipe, Tal + P.Emerald). Corrected to Light Belt / Sharkskin Belt / Vampirefang Belt per diablo2.io recipe-caster-belt-t3880, Arreat Summit, d2runewizard.",
      "reason": "Historical review log; current guidance is in the guide body"
    },
    {
      "id": "guides/warlock.html#s6:15",
      "text": "2026-09-18 \u2014 Belt item codes went lbl zlb ulc \u2192 vbl xtb utc \u2192 vbl zvb uvc; xtb is Battle Boots and utc is Troll Belt. Codes verified against d2data armor.json and the PD2 Item_Codes wiki. Filter updated in the same pass.",
      "reason": "Historical review log; current guidance is in the guide body"
    },
    {
      "id": "guides/warlock.html#s6:16",
      "text": "2026-09-18 \u2014 Caster Ring had \u201c5\u201310 % FCR\u201d as a fixed mod; the ring craft has no fixed FCR (+1\u20135 energy instead). A 10 FCR caster ring is a rolled suffix.",
      "reason": "Historical review log; current guidance is in the guide body"
    },
    {
      "id": "guides/warlock.html#s6:17",
      "text": "2026-09-18 \u2014 Regenerate Mana on Caster Boots / Belt / Gloves is 4\u201310 %, not 5\u201310 % (Arreat Summit, d2tomb, d2runewizard agree).",
      "reason": "Historical review log; current guidance is in the guide body"
    },
    {
      "id": "guides/warlock.html#s6:18",
      "text": "2026-09-19 \u2014 Added \u00a70 upgrade path from a full gear/stat screenshot check; it supersedes the earlier in-chat \u201cHotO is better than Wizardspike\u201d verdict, which ignored that Wizardspike carries the resist cap on this gear.",
      "reason": "Historical review log; current guidance is in the guide body"
    },
    {
      "id": "guides/warlock.html#s6:19",
      "text": "2026-09-20 \u2014 Grand Crown moved out of Bases ARMOR into a new Superior + gray only rule (same shape as the Bases WEAPONS Gray split) after a 2os Superior copy and then a plain white one showed on runs. Plain white Grand Crown is now hidden; lootfilter/warlock_echoing_strike.json not touched.",
      "reason": "Historical review log; current guidance is in the guide body"
    },
    {
      "id": "guides/warlock.html#s6:20",
      "text": "2026-09-19 \u2014 Bases WEAPONS split: polearms / spears, PB / BA / CB, bows and Crystal Sword moved to a Superior + gray only rule (rarity hiQuality + eth/socketed flag, no normal) after a plain white Thresher showed on a run. Daggers, Flail and Talons keep plain whites.",
      "reason": "Historical review log; current guidance is in the guide body"
    },
    {
      "id": "guides/warlock.html#s6:21",
      "text": "2026-09-18 \u2014 Filter narrowing pass: magic boots/belts limited to the six craft bases; rare class categories, rare elite armors / polearms / scepters / orbs, 1-socket daggers and 2-socket claws hidden; white Mask / Crown / Preserved Head hidden; Blade and Stiletto added to the Void line. Magic gloves were dropped, then restored (Lancer's / Archer's / Kenshi's \u2026 of Alacrity sell).",
      "reason": "Historical review log; current guidance is in the guide body"
    },
    {
      "id": "guides/warlock.html#s7:1",
      "text": "Crafted fixed-mod ranges for Caster Belt (FCR) and Caster Boots (max mana) \u2014 from the Arreat Summit table; confirm on the first craft.",
      "reason": "Explicitly unverified appendix; not an asserted item verdict"
    },
    {
      "id": "guides/warlock.html#s7:2",
      "text": "Whether Hell Anya sells daggers / grimoires after patch 3.1.2 (WP-C open question) \u2014 check her weapon tab once.",
      "reason": "Explicitly unverified appendix; not an asserted item verdict"
    },
    {
      "id": "guides/warlock.html#s7:3",
      "text": "After importing the 2026-09-20 narrowing, verify plain Kris and the six generic armor bases are hidden, Superior/socketed/ethereal copies remain shown, and plain Flail remains shown. Check Tiara/Diadem bases are hidden while magic/rare copies remain visible; use Alt to compare.",
      "reason": "Explicitly unverified appendix; not an asserted item verdict"
    },
    {
      "id": "guides/warlock.html#s7:4",
      "text": "Whether the Bases WEAPONS Gray rule (hiQuality + flag, no normal) hides a plain 0os Thresher yet still shows a non-eth socketed one \u2014 the \u201cnormal also matches gray\u201d behaviour is from forum posts, not tested here.",
      "reason": "Explicitly unverified appendix; not an asserted item verdict"
    },
    {
      "id": "guides/warlock.html#s7:5",
      "text": "Exact mods of the merc helm runewords Cure (Shael-Io-Tal) and Bulwark (Shael-Io-Sol) \u2014 recipes from the d2runewizard index (pricing/raw/d2runes-index.html); the per-runeword pages are script-rendered and gave no text. Look up before spending the runes (\u00a70.1). Also whether a Holy Freeze merc's Meditation aura from Insight heals \u2014 assumed no.",
      "reason": "Explicitly unverified appendix; not an asserted item verdict"
    },
    {
